tmp
# Each program's goodbye receipt, its last run's beside it, and one half
# written. Run artefacts, not source (issue 101).
output/goodbye-*

# Each voice's clones of the project, when they do not fit in RAM (issue
# 501). Each is a git repository of its own.
/clones/

# The embedding index, built on each machine from its own checkout by the
# git hooks (issue 502), its half-built copy and its lock.
/.embedding-index*
